This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/backlog-reverify.sh, scripts/backlog-rotate.sh and the docs/backlog.md
corpus — this repository's own carry-over backlog. None of the three is installed: install.sh's
copy loop derives from core/scripts/ and never touches the repo-root scripts/, and a consumer
tree gets no docs/backlog.md. On a consumer this fixture would resolve no tool and no ledger,
and could only pass.

A consumer's equivalent is the push-candidate ledger under _bmad-output/ai-dlc-update/, whose
own fixtures (ledger-reverify, ledger-rotate, ledger-status-vocabulary,
ledger-reverify-unfalsifiable) ship and cover it. This one must not be confused for those.
